  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fernao Dias Highway Modernization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin Carretera Fernao Das</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT COMPRISES THE FIRST STAGE OF THE MODERNIZATION AND CAPACITY IMPROVEMENT OF THE FEDERAL ROAD BR-381, NAMED FERNAO DIAS, WHICH LINKS BELO HORIZONTE AND SAO PAULO (563 KM). THE FIRST STAGE WILL IMPROVE 270 KM, OF THIS LENGHT 217 KM ARE LOCATED IN THE STATE OF MINAS GERAIS AND 53 KM IN THE STATE OF SAO PAULO.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
